WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-People might not
know this about you,

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you were the voice
on "Gossip Girl."

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.238 size:81% position:41%
You were the narrator.
-Oh. Yes, I was. Yeah.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:05.772 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-And we asked --

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:08.475
You were very kind to say yes
to this, because we have --

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We feel as though

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of Donald Trump tweets
feel very gossipy.

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:13.780 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.281 size:78% position:39%
-And so we have asked
if you wouldn't mind

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.685
reading a few of them with the
classic "Gossip Girl" send-off.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:22.756
So, if you just want to go
over here. And thank you again.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:24.157 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Seth, I am honored.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.859 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.693 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:31.031
[ As Gossip Girl ] "Ex-NSA
contractor to spend 63 months

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:34.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
in jail over
'classified' information.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.536 line:92%
Gee, this is 'small potatoes'

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
compared to what
Hillary Clinton did!

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.041 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So unfair, Jeff.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Double standard.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.511 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
XOXO, Gossip Girl."

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.279 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.480 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just a couple more.
Just 'cause --

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-All right.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:55.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Who can figure out
the true meaning of 'covfefe'?

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:59.592 line:92%
Enjoy! XOXO, Gossip Girl."

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
These do sound like...
-Yeah.

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...the things that were
written on the show.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:05.965
-And, then, this is just, like,
a personal thing for me,

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.133 size:84% position:42% line:92%
as a "Gossip Girl" fan,

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
just to hear my voice
in your voice

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
will be an honor.
-[ Clears throat ]

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:15.975
"Congratulations to Seth Meyers
on 'Emmy's Rating Tumble.'

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:19.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just as I predicted,
Seth bombed!

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
XOXO, Gossip Girl."

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Kristen bell, everybody!

